      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING CHOI (4) had been in great form but was out of the placings last run, finishing fifth (20.73) in a Grade 5 at Traralgon. Generally a safe beginner but never in it last time. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Rates on top in this line up. ROLLING EXPRESS (1) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when third beaten 1.1 lengths (19.75). Yet to win here but has run some good races including four placings. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Well placed and gets his chance. WILD VENUS (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fifth (19.74) in a Grade 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Rates a winning chance on best. FLYING NARDO (6) is a last start winner who rates one of the chances again.",
